## UI documentation

Human-readable design system (required reading for UI work):

- `docs/ui/README.md`: index, the rules in one screen, the UI gate
- `docs/ui/design-system.md`: tokens and tints, Onest and the Notion type scale, radii, the home cover, motion
- `docs/ui/surfaces.md`: page, sidebar, tile, frame, float, inverted
- `docs/ui/page-shell.md`: BaseLayout, sidebar, top bar, closing line, page patterns, the home
- `docs/ui/components.md`: primitives, copy, Umami events
- `docs/ui/platforms.md`: visitor, user, admin, auth

Full UI rules: the "UI rules (mandatory)" section of `AGENTS.md`  
Enforced by: `src/__tests__/unit/lib/ui-gate.test.ts` (run by `bun run test`)  
Tokens: `src/app/globals.css`, `tailwind.config.ts`, `src/lib/design-system.ts`, `src/lib/theme-hex.ts`

## Progress tracking

- Read `prd/feature.md` then `prd/progress.md` before feature work
- Update `prd/progress.md` after completing tasks
